  "title": "Today’s financial consumer: Open for business (part 2 of 2)",
  "summary": "We are in the early days of the emerging open banking ecosystem, enabled by open API technology and accelerated by regulators, as seen with PSD2 in Europe. Because there is precious little attention paid to what consumers think of this trend, we added a set of questions to test consumers’ openness to using third-party providers for commonplace banking services.",
